      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Use this after you cancel a video that fal had already started, after a run times out, or after ComfyUI restarts while a video is being made. fal keeps working on the request, and the pack keeps a record of it.\n\n1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. In `request`, choose the video. Each entry shows its request ID, its model, and when it started, in UTC. Press R to list requests started after the page loaded.\n3. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/fal`.\n\nA request leaves the list once its video is saved. fal keeps a finished request's result for a limited time, and the node says so when it is gone."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
